# Trivy ignore list — unfixable CVEs in the Debian bookworm base image.
# Reviewed: 2026-04-22. Re-evaluate when upgrading the base image.

# libsqlite3-0: integer overflow — no fix available in Debian 12 (status: affected)
# DeepHunter uses MariaDB as its primary database; SQLite is not used at runtime.
CVE-2025-7458

# zlib1g: integer overflow in minizip's zipOpenNewFileInZip4_64 —
# Debian marks this will_not_fix; the vulnerable function is in the minizip
# contrib code, not in the core zlib compression library used at runtime.
CVE-2023-45853
